WEBVTT

00:03.430 --> 00:05.370
An elite boy's school.

00:05.530 --> 00:08.370
I transferred after the semester began.

00:08.540 --> 00:11.370
I had no idea what was waiting for me.

00:11.510 --> 00:14.270
I thought it was just a school full of guys...

00:14.380 --> 00:15.640
...but why do I see a girl?

00:15.780 --> 00:16.870
I'm a guy!

00:16.980 --> 00:17.540
Huh?

00:17.650 --> 00:18.840
But that skirt...

00:18.950 --> 00:20.920
What are you saying?
You're going to wear it too.

00:21.020 --> 00:21.510
What?

00:21.620 --> 00:23.850
The three of us are in this together.

00:23.950 --> 00:25.650
Let's do a great job, okay?

00:25.750 --> 00:27.350
No!

00:27.520 --> 00:31.360
And this is how my life as a princess began...

00:31.930 --> 00:38.560
<i>After I met you, you shed</i> <i>some light onto my heart.</i>

00:38.700 --> 00:45.300
<i>I spent my days doing the</i> <i>same things all the time.</i>

00:46.210 --> 00:51.270
<i>I know what I want to</i> <i>say to you every time.</i>

00:51.410 --> 00:57.980
<i>I always have them</i> <i>hidden inside my heart.</i>

00:58.950 --> 01:03.650
<i>I know it's an important feeling...</i>

01:03.890 --> 01:09.330
<i>...and I'm keeping it warm</i> <i>to give it to you someday.</i>

01:11.630 --> 01:17.300
<i>The sound of the bells</i>
<i>I hear from far away...</i>

01:17.410 --> 01:24.210
<i>...makes my heart beat faster and</i> <i>cuts through the sky like the wind.</i>

01:24.350 --> 01:31.010
<i>After I met you, you shed</i> <i>some light onto my heart.</i>

01:31.120 --> 01:36.820
<i>I spent my days doing the</i> <i>same things all the time.</i>

01:37.030 --> 01:43.690
<i>And when it's time to tell you</i> <i>the things I've been wanting to say...</i>

01:43.830 --> 01:49.500
<i>You're my sunshine, an eternal smile!</i>

01:49.810 --> 01:59.800
<i>Our prologue, to this exciting story...</i>

02:02.120 --> 02:07.580
<i>Time for Lovers</i>

02:11.160 --> 02:12.960
<i>School Festival</i>

02:13.560 --> 02:15.760
Welcome!

02:16.400 --> 02:18.590
Welcome everyone!

02:18.700 --> 02:21.470
This is the program for today, please.

02:22.170 --> 02:23.730
Come on Mikoto!

02:24.240 --> 02:27.640
He's been restless since his girlfriend's coming.

02:27.740 --> 02:30.770
I want to get out of here soon...

02:30.950 --> 02:33.040
You still have time before you see her.

02:33.150 --> 02:34.980
Keep working.

02:35.120 --> 02:36.050
But...

02:36.150 --> 02:37.120
Princesses!

02:37.590 --> 02:40.450
Can you come to our refreshment booth and make the crowd excited?

02:40.560 --> 02:41.350
What?

02:41.460 --> 02:43.250
We don't have enough customers.

02:43.360 --> 02:44.450
I understand.

02:44.690 --> 02:46.180
Let's go!

02:48.330 --> 02:49.460
Alright!

02:49.560 --> 02:51.060
You won princess!

02:51.230 --> 02:52.530
I did it!

02:51.900 --> 02:52.530
<i>Princess!</i>

02:52.630 --> 02:54.830
Please come down to the booth for judo club as well!

02:54.940 --> 02:57.630
Princess, please come down to the exhibition for the biology club as well!

02:57.740 --> 02:58.710
Come to the art club too!

02:58.810 --> 03:00.500
Yes, I got it!

03:00.610 --> 03:02.580
When can I get out of here?

03:02.680 --> 03:05.080
<i>Reserved for student organization</i>

03:07.820 --> 03:10.620
Well, I'm sorry for letting you guys do the rest, but good luck!

03:10.950 --> 03:13.150
I'll be back before the play starts in the afternoon!

03:13.260 --> 03:14.450
Yeah, yeah.

03:14.820 --> 03:20.020
While you're out seeing your girlfriend, we'll be doing this princess job.

03:20.130 --> 03:24.500
Well, you don't have to worry about it.

03:24.630 --> 03:26.120
Enjoy your date!

03:28.500 --> 03:29.970
You're tormenting me right?

03:30.070 --> 03:30.870
What?

03:31.010 --> 03:34.070
It's okay, you don't have to say it indirectly.

03:34.210 --> 03:35.340
Hmm?

03:36.510 --> 03:40.510
I guess we don't have any important jobs in the morning, right?

03:40.650 --> 03:45.020
We just have to go around and excite the crowds at several club events.

03:45.790 --> 03:48.380
But there's one thing that worries us.

03:48.490 --> 03:49.550
That's right.

03:49.660 --> 03:52.290
The festival today is open to the general public.

03:52.390 --> 03:53.450
That's right.

03:53.700 --> 03:56.690
But those people don't know anything, so there's nothing to worry about.

03:57.100 --> 03:58.190
Be careful.

03:58.300 --> 03:59.630
That's right.

03:59.740 --> 04:05.000
We might bump into each other by chance.

04:05.640 --> 04:06.470
Sorry!

04:06.580 --> 04:08.540
I'm really sorry!

04:08.640 --> 04:09.740
Not again.

04:09.850 --> 04:12.540
You think we'll forgive you if you bow like that?

04:12.650 --> 04:13.270
Right?

04:13.380 --> 04:16.550
I don't have any problem introducing her to you.

04:16.790 --> 04:20.220
It's just that we don't want to come together...

04:20.520 --> 04:21.550
Yeah, yeah.

04:21.720 --> 04:23.390
We're just a nuisance.

04:23.490 --> 04:26.490
We'll make sure not to bump into you, so don't worry.

04:26.660 --> 04:31.960
Anyway, just don't appear before us looking strange like that!

04:32.070 --> 04:33.470
Strange?

04:34.840 --> 04:36.360
Strange?

04:37.040 --> 04:39.630
We look strange?

04:39.740 --> 04:41.270
What do you mean we look strange?

04:41.380 --> 04:43.810
You're also wearing this strange wardrobe too!

04:43.980 --> 04:45.410
I got it!

04:45.510 --> 04:47.850
We're definitely going to see Mikoto and his girlfriend!

04:48.020 --> 04:49.010
What?

04:49.120 --> 04:50.240
Let's go Yujirou!

04:50.350 --> 04:50.980
Yeah!

04:51.290 --> 04:52.550
Wait!

04:55.260 --> 04:57.520
W-What should I do?

04:59.360 --> 05:02.730
I'll make sure that I don't bump into them!

05:02.830 --> 05:04.300
<i>School festival</i>

05:09.870 --> 05:10.960
Megumi!

05:12.270 --> 05:14.680
Megumi! You're right on time!

05:14.810 --> 05:18.070
Makoto led me here.

05:15.080 --> 05:18.070
<i>Don't you have anything to say to me?</i>

05:18.210 --> 05:20.150
Your clothes look cute today Megumi!

05:20.320 --> 05:21.440
Mikoto!

05:22.050 --> 05:24.490
You should be thanking me!

05:24.620 --> 05:25.420
What? Why?

05:26.220 --> 05:27.880
Look. We're a matching pair!

05:27.990 --> 05:30.050
I was the one who coordinated this!

05:31.490 --> 05:33.990
Damn! You know I...

05:34.130 --> 05:36.660
Megumi and I want to be...

05:38.000 --> 05:39.190
Like this!

05:42.200 --> 05:46.400
Why did I imagine myself wearing a princess outfit?

05:46.540 --> 05:49.600
Why are you behaving suspiciously?

05:50.250 --> 05:51.740
No, it's nothing.

05:51.850 --> 05:53.840
Let's just go inside...

05:54.850 --> 05:55.870
Makoto!

05:56.280 --> 06:00.240
I'll just leave you two alone, even though he just pretends to be your boyfriend.

06:00.360 --> 06:02.020
I'm not pretending! I am her boyfriend!

06:02.120 --> 06:03.520
I'll see you in an hour!

06:03.630 --> 06:05.320
I'll see you later Makoto!

06:06.160 --> 06:08.290
Geez...

06:08.430 --> 06:09.520
Mikoto.

06:11.170 --> 06:12.400
Should we go?

06:12.530 --> 06:14.660
Yeah! I'll show you around!

06:23.510 --> 06:25.410
I don't see Mikoto!

06:25.550 --> 06:27.540
He's probably hiding somewhere!

06:27.720 --> 06:29.120
By the way Tohru...

06:29.250 --> 06:30.580
Yeah, I know...

06:31.150 --> 06:34.180
This is like "The Pied Piper of Hamelin"

06:34.290 --> 06:35.310
Yeah...

06:35.590 --> 06:38.220
I wonder what they think of us.

06:38.390 --> 06:41.760
Since it's a school festival, they think we're just dressed up.

06:41.860 --> 06:45.630
Or maybe they think we're really girls...

06:47.170 --> 06:48.360
What should we do?

06:48.600 --> 06:51.100
If we deal with them, then things will get complicated...

06:51.210 --> 06:54.010
Yeah, it'll turn out bad if we don't do something...

06:54.380 --> 06:55.670
Hey you guys!

06:55.780 --> 06:56.940
Akira!

06:57.380 --> 06:59.780
Must be tough for you during this school festival.

07:00.180 --> 07:02.620
But you're also working too right?

07:02.720 --> 07:03.710
What are you doing here?

07:03.820 --> 07:08.280
I'm just walking around to see if everything is in order.

07:08.590 --> 07:12.050
We thought you were with the president all this time.

07:12.790 --> 07:15.730
That president is making me do this.

07:15.900 --> 07:18.490
Anyway, you guys have lots of people behind you...

07:18.600 --> 07:21.400
I know, they followed us around and we don't know what to do.

07:21.540 --> 07:24.340
We can't just get rid of them bluntly...

07:24.440 --> 07:25.340
Okay.

07:25.540 --> 07:27.840
Can you lend me the bullhorn?

07:31.310 --> 07:35.050
Everyone, if you stand there, you're blocking the way for other people.

07:35.480 --> 07:39.220
There are many other interesting shows and events...

07:39.320 --> 07:41.690
...so why not go to those instead?

07:41.790 --> 07:44.120
In the first gymnasium is the band concert.

07:44.230 --> 07:46.660
In the second gymnasium is the film screening.

07:46.760 --> 07:48.730
On the second floor of the east building is the haunted house.

07:48.830 --> 07:51.060
And we have games on the first floor.

07:55.340 --> 07:56.860
That should do it.

07:56.970 --> 07:57.910
Marvelous!

07:58.440 --> 08:01.310
I guess we have our next president!

08:01.410 --> 08:06.140
I mean, who has more leadership skills than this man?

08:06.250 --> 08:07.180
What?

08:12.350 --> 08:16.350
I see, so this is your school.

08:16.990 --> 08:18.960
This building is quite new.

08:19.290 --> 08:22.700
Yeah, this place is very old, but they rebuilt the facilities in the Heisei era.

08:22.800 --> 08:25.060
Megumi is really cute...

08:26.430 --> 08:30.460
I know she looks good everytime, but she looks much prettier than usual.

08:30.810 --> 08:33.470
I don't like the fact that she wears the same thing as Makoto but...

08:33.580 --> 08:34.910
Hey Mikoto...

08:35.080 --> 08:35.700
What?

08:35.810 --> 08:38.910
They all looked this way and said something about a princess.

08:39.010 --> 08:40.280
Am I just hearing things?

08:41.050 --> 08:41.780
Hey...

08:42.080 --> 08:44.480
That's probably because you're pretty like a princess...

08:44.590 --> 08:46.610
...and they're just fascinated by you!

08:46.760 --> 08:49.220
But it seems like they're saying it to you...

08:49.520 --> 08:50.510
Princess!

08:50.630 --> 08:52.420
Miko-chan!

08:53.500 --> 08:58.090
Don't talk to me!

08:58.970 --> 09:01.300
Let's go, Megumi!

09:03.070 --> 09:05.200
He's not the same today...

09:05.310 --> 09:05.800
Yeah...

09:07.340 --> 09:09.070
It's past 11:30...

09:09.780 --> 09:12.770
We still have time until the play, so what do you want to do?

09:12.910 --> 09:14.350
Should we get back?

09:14.480 --> 09:16.850
I'm worried if Mikoto can return on time.

09:16.990 --> 09:18.980
I said it's okay!

09:19.090 --> 09:21.080
Don't say that. We'll show you around.

09:21.190 --> 09:21.850
Yeah!

09:21.960 --> 09:23.620
So annoying! Don't come near me!

09:24.160 --> 09:25.250
Are they trying to ask her out?

09:25.360 --> 09:28.490
It's not against the rules, but we should stop them since it's a nuisance.

09:28.600 --> 09:29.060
Yeah.

09:29.530 --> 09:32.230
You people! Didn't you hear what I just said?

09:33.840 --> 09:36.360
Or maybe you're just too dense to understand me?

09:37.010 --> 09:38.840
I'll say it one more time!

09:39.010 --> 09:40.670
You're annoying, so disappear!

09:40.780 --> 09:41.470
Yes!

09:42.010 --> 09:44.880
Hey, doesn't she look like Mikoto?

09:45.050 --> 09:48.450
Yeah, especially that displeased look on her face...

09:48.620 --> 09:49.950
You two...

09:50.320 --> 09:51.750
What are you two supposed to be?

09:51.850 --> 09:54.290
We tried to stop them but...

09:54.490 --> 09:57.460
But you got rid of them before we could...

09:57.560 --> 10:00.090
Of course I was able to handle them. It's only natural.

10:00.200 --> 10:01.390
<i>Only natural?</i>

10:01.530 --> 10:05.060
Geez, they said something about a princess and kept following me.

10:05.170 --> 10:06.600
What was that all about?

10:06.900 --> 10:10.860
Excuse me but do you have any relatives attending this school?

10:11.110 --> 10:12.700
Yes, I have a younger brother.

10:12.810 --> 10:14.970
Could his name be Mikoto Yutaka?

10:15.110 --> 10:16.600
Yeah, that's him!

10:17.610 --> 10:18.440
I knew it!

10:18.550 --> 10:19.640
You do look like him!

10:19.950 --> 10:20.920
Oh my!

10:21.280 --> 10:22.810
You're Mikoto's older sister?

10:22.920 --> 10:25.550
Yes, but you both have different personalities!

10:25.650 --> 10:27.920
Mikoto can't handle the situation like that.

10:28.220 --> 10:29.850
Then you people are...

10:30.020 --> 10:31.420
Boys?

10:31.660 --> 10:33.920
You're dressed really cute but...

10:34.030 --> 10:35.550
<i>This is bad...</i>

10:35.730 --> 10:38.790
But my brother might look real cute in that outfit too.

10:38.970 --> 10:40.730
Um...

10:39.270 --> 10:40.740
<i>This is really bad...</i>

10:42.300 --> 10:45.640
He might hate wearing it though!

10:45.770 --> 10:48.470
You're absolutely right, sister!

10:48.740 --> 10:50.040
Where should we go next?

10:49.480 --> 10:50.600
<i>Megumi!</i>

10:50.710 --> 10:52.480
And the other guy, Mikoto.

10:52.610 --> 10:54.550
Why am I "the other guy"?

11:08.260 --> 11:09.630
Hi Mikoto!

11:09.760 --> 11:12.600
You look just like your sister Mikoto!

11:12.830 --> 11:15.270
Are they your friends Mikoto?

11:15.470 --> 11:17.460
Why are they dressed like girls?

11:18.310 --> 11:20.670
So you're Mikoto's girlfriend?

11:21.440 --> 11:23.640
I heard a lot about you.

11:23.810 --> 11:27.840
The way he talked about you sounded like he's a doting parent...

11:27.950 --> 11:29.710
...but I can see that he wasn't.

11:30.190 --> 11:32.250
Wait a minute...

11:32.420 --> 11:33.720
She's definitely pretty!

11:33.820 --> 11:37.420
They said Mikoto looks like a pretty girl, but she's just as good!

11:37.690 --> 11:42.390
But when she stands next to him, it's like a pretty girl idol unit, right?

11:42.500 --> 11:42.860
Yeah.

11:42.960 --> 11:44.400
You two!

11:48.200 --> 11:50.040
What are you doing here?

11:50.340 --> 11:51.810
What are we doing here?

11:51.910 --> 11:54.310
You guys approached us in the first place!

11:54.580 --> 11:55.700
Nevermind that.

11:55.810 --> 11:58.300
You didn't forget about your work this afternoon, right?

11:58.410 --> 12:00.380
You didn't say anything to Makoto, right?

12:00.520 --> 12:03.490
I really wanted to tell her but I didn't.

12:04.490 --> 12:07.610
But your sister found out the truth about you.

12:07.860 --> 12:09.290
No way! About what?

12:09.820 --> 12:11.420
Hey Mikoto.

12:11.560 --> 12:14.260
Why did you leave us to talk to them?

12:14.900 --> 12:16.590
Well, it's just...

12:16.930 --> 12:20.600
You guys seem very friendly, but are you all in the same class?

12:20.700 --> 12:22.970
No, Mikoto is in a different class.

12:23.070 --> 12:24.400
Then you guys are in the same club?

12:24.540 --> 12:26.570
No, that's not it either.

12:26.740 --> 12:28.470
Then how did you guys meet?

12:28.610 --> 12:29.700
Well...

12:30.040 --> 12:33.670
Oh yeah! We have the same duty in the student organization!

12:33.820 --> 12:35.780
Yeah, the student organization!

12:35.920 --> 12:36.820
I see...

12:37.520 --> 12:40.650
You know, I just remembered!
We have some work to do now.

12:40.760 --> 12:42.420
You too, right, Mikoto?

12:42.520 --> 12:44.190
Oh yeah! That's right.

12:44.530 --> 12:46.190
Oh I see.

12:46.630 --> 12:49.260
Then we'll just take a look around ourselves.

12:49.530 --> 12:50.690
Let's go Megumi.

12:51.770 --> 12:52.630
No!

12:52.770 --> 12:54.860
It'll be bad if you stay here any longer!

12:54.970 --> 12:56.130
Why?

12:56.240 --> 12:58.300
It's just...

12:56.940 --> 12:58.300
<i>He can't say it...</i>

12:58.440 --> 13:00.810
That he's going to dress up like a girl...

13:01.510 --> 13:05.740
He doesn't want other guys to go after her, right?

13:06.010 --> 13:10.110
There's so many dangerous guys around, so you're worried about her, right?

13:11.150 --> 13:12.280
That's right!

13:12.390 --> 13:15.410
I can't let anything happen to you!

13:15.590 --> 13:18.360
So you have to go home immediately!

13:18.490 --> 13:20.330
I want you to head straight home!

13:20.600 --> 13:21.760
Fine...

13:22.600 --> 13:23.220
But...

13:23.600 --> 13:26.230
Thank you for coming today.

13:26.600 --> 13:28.190
I was happy to see you.

13:28.300 --> 13:30.470
I'll call you and email you again.

13:30.640 --> 13:33.730
You have to study, you don't need to force yourself.

13:34.210 --> 13:35.640
I'm not forcing myself!

13:35.940 --> 13:38.410
It pains me when I can't contact you!

13:39.050 --> 13:42.140
Now it's my turn to visit you...

13:46.750 --> 13:48.350
Sorry for interrupting...

13:48.490 --> 13:50.390
We'll be waiting for you.

13:50.630 --> 13:51.220
Seeya!

13:53.490 --> 13:56.190
Well Megumi, I have to go too.

13:56.860 --> 13:59.530
I really want to walk you to the front gate, but I can't.

13:59.670 --> 14:00.530
I'm sorry.

14:00.670 --> 14:01.900
You don't have to.

14:02.000 --> 14:04.270
I want you to head home immediately, okay?

14:04.370 --> 14:05.930
I got it...

14:06.510 --> 14:09.140
Makoto, take care of Megumi!

14:09.340 --> 14:11.440
I know what I'm doing!

14:11.550 --> 14:13.950
<i>Reserved for student organization</i>

14:15.750 --> 14:17.880
W-What's the matter with you two?

14:20.250 --> 14:21.450
Listen to this Akira!

14:21.560 --> 14:24.580
Mikoto's attitude changes when he's dealing with his girlfriend!

14:24.860 --> 14:25.920
Plus...

14:26.990 --> 14:29.860
Now it's my turn to visit you...

14:30.700 --> 14:33.130
That's what he said to her!

14:33.230 --> 14:37.330
It's funny to see two pretty girls in that situation!

14:37.640 --> 14:41.010
You shouldn't laugh at them, it's rude.

14:47.320 --> 14:49.280
What's wrong with you two?

14:49.380 --> 14:50.610
Hey you two!

14:50.720 --> 14:53.420
We'll be late for the play if we don't get ready!

14:53.550 --> 14:54.540
Stop laughing!

14:57.190 --> 15:00.030
Now, what should we look at next?

15:01.060 --> 15:02.530
Those two...

15:02.630 --> 15:03.100
What?

15:03.200 --> 15:06.260
Those two we met before were really boys, right?

15:06.370 --> 15:07.630
That's right.

15:09.370 --> 15:12.360
They're just friends, right?

15:12.540 --> 15:13.670
Megumi!

15:13.810 --> 15:16.140
Mikoto only thinks about you!

15:16.280 --> 15:18.270
Besides, they're boys!

15:19.510 --> 15:23.250
But he likes a girl like me.

15:23.450 --> 15:26.350
Even though he's a guy, if he sees pretty-looking guys like them--

15:26.450 --> 15:27.510
That's impossible!

15:28.360 --> 15:32.120
You're so much prettier than Mikoto's friends!

15:32.390 --> 15:36.350
Well, I don't care who looks prettier...

15:36.560 --> 15:40.560
That modest attitude... He doesn't act that way with me...

15:42.400 --> 15:45.270
I'm sure he acts differently in front of his friends than with you.

15:45.370 --> 15:46.840
Isn't that obvious?

15:47.040 --> 15:47.970
I guess...

15:48.140 --> 15:51.270
Geez! Don't tell
Mikoto about this, okay?

15:51.850 --> 15:53.210
You're right.

15:53.310 --> 15:55.310
If he finds out that I suspected his relationship with his friends...

15:55.450 --> 15:56.120
No!

15:56.120 --> 15:56.640
What?

15:56.980 --> 15:59.110
I just can't stand seeing Mikoto excited...

15:59.220 --> 16:01.750
...when he finds out that you're really worried about him.

16:01.860 --> 16:02.720
Makoto...

16:02.820 --> 16:03.920
Now let's go!

16:04.130 --> 16:06.530
What? But Mikoto told us to go home...

16:07.360 --> 16:08.420
Are you stupid?

16:08.530 --> 16:10.590
The reason why he kept reminding us to go home...

16:10.700 --> 16:13.670
...is because he's holding something back!

16:13.870 --> 16:16.670
Well I'm sure he has some things that are private.

16:16.770 --> 16:19.000
Let's just do what he tells us, Makoto!

16:20.240 --> 16:21.680
Makoto!

16:31.690 --> 16:33.990
I hope Megumi went home...

16:34.160 --> 16:35.520
Too bad!

16:35.720 --> 16:37.990
She's not here to see you perform!

16:38.390 --> 16:39.450
Shut up!

16:41.300 --> 16:42.390
It's starting!

16:42.530 --> 16:44.230
Don't make a sour face!

16:44.370 --> 16:45.630
Who's fault is it?

16:46.170 --> 16:47.930
Thank you for waiting everyone!

16:48.040 --> 16:51.060
Student organization presents, starring the princesses!

16:51.170 --> 16:53.970
We now present "Princess Wonderland"

17:06.590 --> 17:12.460
A long, long time ago, there were 3 beautiful princesses.

17:12.590 --> 17:18.360
But their stepmother envied their beauty and youth.

17:21.270 --> 17:23.600
I told them to do Alice in Wonderland!

17:23.840 --> 17:26.000
The wardrobes and the play don't match!

17:26.110 --> 17:27.630
The stage needs to have a fairy tale setting...

17:27.740 --> 17:29.370
...in order for the wardrobes to stand out!

17:29.480 --> 17:31.670
Since it doesn't look like the world of Alice...

17:31.780 --> 17:33.980
...those mini aprons and skirts don't look good either!

17:35.380 --> 17:37.410
I see, so this is the reason...

17:37.520 --> 17:38.110
What?

17:38.350 --> 17:41.850
He can't hide anything from me!

17:42.260 --> 17:45.280
Yes, don't give up! We need to keep on moving!

17:46.030 --> 17:49.790
Now, we'll be taking a 10 minute break.

17:50.700 --> 17:52.560
One more stage left...

17:52.670 --> 17:53.790
This is the last one!

17:53.900 --> 17:55.230
Let's do a good job!

17:55.800 --> 17:58.800
Ouch! Why are you standing there?

17:59.010 --> 18:01.410
Your performance was great Mikoto!

18:01.540 --> 18:03.740
That wardrobe looks really good on you too!

18:09.050 --> 18:11.420
Mikoto's frozen!

18:11.620 --> 18:13.780
Look what you did!

18:13.890 --> 18:17.260
We have one more stage to go but he's no use to us now!

18:17.790 --> 18:19.450
Oh, I'm sorry.

18:19.560 --> 18:22.830
I didn't like the fact that he was hiding something.

18:22.960 --> 18:23.860
What?

18:24.970 --> 18:27.090
Don't worry, I'll take care of him.

18:27.370 --> 18:28.860
Do you have any vacant rooms?

18:29.000 --> 18:29.630
What?

18:29.870 --> 18:31.460
Okay Megumi, I'm counting on you!

18:31.570 --> 18:35.630
Fine, but stop picking on Mikoto if you can't fix him yourself.

18:39.080 --> 18:41.640
Well, you can just wait out here.

18:44.720 --> 18:46.620
Are you sure you can fix him?

18:46.720 --> 18:50.780
When he gets damaged, it's really hard for him to snap out of it...

18:50.890 --> 18:52.330
Don't worry about it!

19:04.470 --> 19:05.630
Mikoto...

19:06.910 --> 19:08.500
Are you okay, Mikoto?

19:08.940 --> 19:10.410
Megumi!

19:12.210 --> 19:14.050
You know what, Mikoto?

19:13.150 --> 19:14.050
<i>Y-Yes!</i>

19:14.280 --> 19:17.120
You're probably feeling shameful, embarrassed...

19:17.220 --> 19:19.350
...and want to crawl into a hole and never come out again...

19:19.450 --> 19:21.420
...or turn back time or have your memories erased.

19:21.590 --> 19:23.150
Am I right?

19:23.620 --> 19:25.020
Megumi...

19:25.490 --> 19:28.330
I know exactly what you're thinking.

19:28.700 --> 19:30.160
Don't worry about it.

19:30.300 --> 19:34.130
I'm not going to hate you for dressing up like a girl.

19:35.740 --> 19:36.470
Megumi...

19:39.070 --> 19:42.440
No matter what you wear, you'll always be Mikoto to me.

19:42.740 --> 19:44.110
Megumi!

19:45.180 --> 19:46.580
Thank you.

19:48.980 --> 19:51.040
I'm going now. I have work to do.

19:51.150 --> 19:51.950
Yeah.

19:55.660 --> 19:56.780
Bye!

19:56.990 --> 19:58.280
Mikoto!

19:57.690 --> 19:58.280
<i>What?</i>

20:05.100 --> 20:06.800
Are you okay, Mikoto?

20:06.900 --> 20:08.390
Compose yourself!

20:08.670 --> 20:10.190
Hey Mikoto!

20:13.840 --> 20:15.240
Let's do this!

20:15.340 --> 20:17.680
Come on you two, let's go get dressed!

20:17.780 --> 20:18.470
What?

20:19.650 --> 20:20.340
Bye.

20:20.450 --> 20:22.140
Ah, Megumi, I'll see you later!

20:22.580 --> 20:24.710
See? Everything's fine.

20:24.850 --> 20:27.790
Megumi can easily take care of Mikoto.

20:28.460 --> 20:30.020
Hey Miko-chan!

20:30.220 --> 20:31.890
Princess! Look this way!

20:32.090 --> 20:33.290
Yes!

20:33.890 --> 20:36.590
He can smile back with confidence...

20:36.700 --> 20:38.390
What happened?

20:52.350 --> 20:54.080
This is the end of the school festival...

20:54.180 --> 20:55.170
Yeah...

21:02.920 --> 21:04.510
Mikoto!

21:03.490 --> 21:04.520
<i>What?</i>

21:17.000 --> 21:18.560
Good luck out there.

21:19.870 --> 21:22.540
Mikoto, why are you laughing to yourself like that?

21:22.640 --> 21:23.510
Tell us!

21:23.610 --> 21:25.940
Tell us everything that happened!

21:27.820 --> 21:29.080
I'm interested!

21:29.180 --> 21:31.520
Well, we'll make you talk no matter what!

21:31.950 --> 21:33.350
He's laughing again!

21:33.450 --> 21:36.050
Damn!

21:43.400 --> 21:50.960
<i>If you're sad and feeling</i> <i>down, then call out to me.</i>

21:51.070 --> 21:59.140
<i>I'll be in the area, so let</i> <i>me know what's bothering you.</i>

21:59.650 --> 22:06.990
<i>If you're all by yourself,</i> <i>then you'll forget how to smile.</i>

22:07.090 --> 22:14.820
<i>A smile is something you</i> <i>share with another person.</i>

22:14.960 --> 22:24.960
<i>Hey, the future you can see</i> <i>from the classroom window...</i>

22:25.210 --> 22:31.810
<i>...is getting larger after</i> <i>taking in the sunlight.</i>

22:32.150 --> 22:33.640
<i>Smile at me!</i>

22:33.780 --> 22:41.520
<i>A smile is what makes you feel energetic!</i>

22:41.620 --> 22:47.620
<i>I want to give some smiles to you...</i>

22:47.760 --> 22:49.790
<i>...right away.</i>

22:50.060 --> 23:00.060
<i>In order for you to lift</i> <i>your head up and start walking.</i>

23:06.610 --> 23:11.580
Next Episode, Secrets of the past
